# MongoDB Atlas Connection Setup
# Follow these steps to connect:

# 1. Create free account at https://www.mongodb.com/atlas
# 2. Create free M0 cluster
# 3. Create database user (username/password)
# 4. Allow all IPs: Network Access → Add IP → 0.0.0.0/0
# 5. Get connection string: Connect → Drivers

# Copy your connection string below (replace username & password):
PORT=5000
MONGODB_URI=mongodb+srv://<username>:<password>@cluster0.xxx.mongodb.net/youtube-clone
JWT_SECRET=your-secret-key-here
